OL,3,GNEWSANearly 150 homes damaged by Storm
OL,4,ABabet flooding to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 150 homes in an Angus town which
OL,7,Fwere devastated by Storm Babet almost
OL,8,Fthree years ago are to be demolished.
OL,10,FHundreds of people who fled their homes
OL,11,Fwhen the South Esk breached flood
OL,12,Fdefences in the River Street area of
OL,13,FBrechin were unable to return for
OL,14,Fmonths and many properties remain
OL,15,Fempty.
OL,17,FCouncillors have approved plans to
OL,18,Fdemolish 150 houses and flats, plus
OL,19,Ffive garages, as well as changes to the
OL,20,Friver's flood defences that could cost
OL,21,Fabout #8.2m.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
